  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ef9ddd957c34c3aa5d2754dd37025f4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chapter_02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Speaker: The Doctor
  CharacterDur: 50
  Sentences:
  - Duration: 0
    Content: Ah, you're awake. Good. Before we begin, let me show you how the ViewFinder
      works.
  - Duration: 0
    Content: With the ViewFinder, you can capture images of your surroundings...
      and more importantly, use them to alter reality itself.
  - Duration: 0
    Content: "Hold up the device, frame what you see, and press the shutter. Simple,
      right?\nSometimes, a photo isn't just a memory \u2014 it's a solution. Try
      placing the picture back where it was taken... see what happens"
  - Duration: 0
    Content: Be careful where you take your shots. A photo taken from the wrong angle
      might not help the way you expect.
  - Duration: 0
    Content: "That\u2019s all you need for now. The rest\u2026 you\u2019ll learn
      by experimenting. Trust your eyes \u2014 and your curiosity."
